          "text": "Description: On August 9, 1997, around 10:40 PM, a witness observing the sky with his nephew was intrigued by the passage of a very bright glowing point that moved slowly. The observation duration was approximately 30 to 40 seconds. The observation was silent. We have limited information, but we can assume that the witness likely observed the passage of an aircraft or satellite.",
